Ex4ABpmW2nqw7OJUCUSeym6e1VktywSUKHlbdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy0Bcj2iBvL4kapzBxPjoggexWs2mX81gCZb_3hu5i7eA&oe=69C517C8"}, {"file_name": "113.png", "id": "932200949318965", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296183_932200952652298_7166229103004231922_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lmfjp8CTp3EQ7kNvwFQzQu4&_nc_oc=Adr-e-VE9Y9qh1wJCtdFN9j-1tFHukGbRedwGPk-1Sl_nEWqWR3uXihFSyL4zVifssY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy8pj8Itpkc4F9P-OEAcoP1XsuSibFP0HGKbuQiXk9vvQ&oe=69C52F96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_2560.png", "id": "985057036727083", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036639_985057043393749_3945160790566893943_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H9VmfJQY2-MQ7kNvwGtvj9P&_nc_oc=AdoriIbUwyfFIHhW5zX-sSlCUQlDCuBYjnKrxp6Qrya_sh1FJTsRR3N4BwStqhTUXqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwCnAV66rCQVg7xPrjOGv8VoKdzRgURhKEBMi8GFecYYA&oe=69C5210F"}, "display_name": "Peak Rhythm", "keywords": ["Peak", "Rhythm", "Climbing", "Beat"], "long_description": "**Peak Rhythm** is a VR rhythm-climbing game where music drives momentum. Every grab and twist powers your robotic platform upward through a neon-soaked city.\n\nSync your moves to a high-octane electronic soundtrack to master the flow and dominate global leaderboards. Blending physical precision with Cyberpunk aesthetics and Y2K energy, your rhythm is your engine.\n\n**Don\u2019t just climb\u2014perform.**\n\n{3227020670835876}\n\n### \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f GAME FEATURES\n\n- **Rhythm-Powered Climbing:** Master \u201cRegular\u201d grabs, \u201cMulti-Twists\u201d (volume knob motion), and \u201cDouble\u201d holds on a 5x5 grid. Perfect hits boost your speed; misses slow you down.\n- **Solo Mastery:** Ascend 8 original tracks across 3 difficulties to perfect your runs. Compete for the highest altitude on map-specific leaderboards.\n- **The Soundtrack:** Launching with music from indie artists **FEISTLING, Killin\u2019 Void, Ion Diary,** and **funiel**, spanning Drum & Bass, Dubstep, and House.\n- **Custom Content:** Includes a fully functional **Beatmap Editor** at launch. Create your own maps with your own music.\n\n{1918357589050667}\n\n### \ud83d\ude80 EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP\n\nThe climb is just beginning. We are committed to delivering frequent updates based on your feedback. Planned features include:\n\n- **Social Multiplayer:** Climb side-by-side with friends in real-time.\n- **Ranked Mode:** Competitive knockout tournaments.\n- **Voice Chat:** In-game communication.\n- **Character Customization:** Personalize your avatar\u2019s look.\n- **Cross-Platform Play:** Expanding to other VR headsets.\n\nJoin our community to help shape the future of Peak Rhythm!\n\n\n**[Discord Link: https://discord.gg/RZuzxpRcyV]**", "short_description": "Ascend to the beat in Peak Rhythm! In this VR rhythm-climbing game, every grab and twist drives your robotic platform upward through a neon-soaked city. Sync your moves to a high-octane electronic soundtrack to master the flow and dominate global leaderboards. Blending physical precision with Cyberpunk aesthetics, your rhythm is your engine. Don\u2019t just climb\u2014perform."}]}, "developer_name": "Zeitlos Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1m9m8oIvVGi1Jxm-RDJnRC5fAazVq8xWyeuEFiFQgQVc/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Impact Inked", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://zeitlos-interactive.com/projects/peak-rhythm", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres"